---
title: "governance_instruction::from_byte_vec (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_cursor: cursor = cursor::new(bytes)
    q_cursor --> q_magic: magic = deserialize_vector(cursor, 4)
    q_magic --> q_check_magic: magic == "PTGM" (0x5054474d)
    q_check_magic --> q_abort_magic: false, abort E_INVALID_GOVERNANCE_MAGIC_VALUE
    q_check_magic --> q_module: true
    q_module --> q_action: module_ = deserialize_u8(cursor)
    q_action --> q_chain: action = governance_action::from_u8(deserialize_u8(cursor))
    q_chain --> q_payload: target_chain_id = deserialize_u16(cursor)
    q_payload --> q_rest: payload = cursor::take_rest(cursor)
    q_rest --> q_validate: validate(instruction)
    q_validate --> q_check_module: module_ == MODULE (1)
    q_check_module --> q_abort_mod: false, abort E_INVALID_GOVERNANCE_MODULE
    q_check_module --> q_check_chain: true
    q_check_chain --> q_abort_chain: target != chain_id AND target != 0, abort E_TARGET_CHAIN_MISMATCH
    q_check_chain --> [*]: valid, return GovernanceInstruction

    note right of q_check_chain
        INV-001: magic must be "PTGM" (Pyth Governance Message)
        INV-002: module must be 1 (Pyth target module)
        INV-003: target_chain_id must be current chain or 0 (global)
    end note
